desc: DrumCloud JS
version: 0.27.1
author: Chmod666music
changelog:
  Bundle the required ReaKit GUI controls so DrumCloud opens with its full interface without a separate ReaKit install.
  Add bundled ReaKit MIT license and attribution files.
  Add a complete dark and gold ReaKit interface with automation-safe custom controls.
  Add Sample Fine Tune and explicit detected-root/tuning apply actions.
  Refine multi-region pitch estimates with fractional-lag cents readout.
  Add user-sample folder groundwork and portable development installation.
  Add per-grain Forward, Backward, Alternate, and Random playback direction.
  Add bounded Density Spread timing while preserving the legacy zero-spread rate.
  Add user-triggered multi-region normalized-autocorrelation root detection.
  Report detected MIDI root, confidence, and analysis status without replacing low-confidence manual roots.
  Fix intermittent out-of-range grain starts and boundary clicks.
  Validate and commit shared grain slots atomically before activation.
  Isolate audio, MIDI, initialization, loading, and GUI loop indices.
  Add interpolation-safe range traversal and graceful invalid-grain retirement.
  Add optional filename-based Auto Root mapping for tonal factory samples.
  Leave beats, noise, percussion, whisper, and unstable samples unmapped.
  Keep active grains inside the selected Sample Start and Sample End range.
  Halve Grain Size in all 46 factory presets for the expanded shared grain pool.
  Add robust 8-voice polyphonic MIDI with per-note pitch, velocity, and grain scheduling.
  Add oldest-voice stealing and matching channel-aware note-off handling.
  Increase the shared grain pool conservatively from 8 to 32 grains.
  Install the factory presets correctly for any REAPER or ReaPack folder layout.
  Keep both bundled credit documents as Markdown throughout installation.
  Prevent the bundled Freesound license manifest from appearing as a JSFX.
  Add filtered Stereo and Ping Pong delay with independent channel times.
  Stabilize Shimmer feedback and add transparent output peak protection.
  Add octave-up Shimmer mode with dual-head pitch-shifted feedback.
  Add stereo Room and Hall Cloud Reverb with size, decay, and damping.
  Add adjustable per-grain Attack and Release envelopes.
  Replace the factory library with 130 CC0 sounds created by REVERBERA.
  Add per-grain Pitch Spread in semitones.
  Initial public beta ReaPack release.
links:
  GitHub repository https://github.com/Chmod666music/DrumCloud-ReaPack
  REVERBERA sound pack https://freesound.org/people/REVERBERA/packs/45512/
  Documentation https://github.com/Chmod666music/DrumCloud-ReaPack/blob/main/README.md
  ReaKit upstream https://github.com/mequaz-sudo/ReaKit
  ReaKit ReaPack repository https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mequaz-sudo/ReaKit/main/index.xml
  Report an issue https://github.com/Chmod666music/DrumCloud-ReaPack/issues
provides:
  ReaKit/Library/*
  ReaKit/LICENSE.txt
  ReaKit/THIRD_PARTY_CREDITS.md
